flowchart TB
  A[User action on finance screen] --> B[HTTP request to finance API]
  B --> C[Route and session layer]
  C --> D{Role policy middleware}
  D -- HTTP 403 --> E[UI shows refusal and hides control]
  D -- allowed --> F{SoD and entry state machine}
  F -- refused --> E
  F -- valid --> G[Entry row updated in transaction]
  G --> H[History row inserted append only]
  H --> I[(Relational database)]
  I --> J[Queue and entry page responses]